sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling, apico-basal buckling & Gómez-Gálvez scutoid tube packing) faithfully reproduces Mus musculus / Drosophila melanogaster epithelial monolayers morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus / Drosophila melanogaster epithelial monolayers specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 82.4/100, audit 2026-10-19-epithelial-buckling-3d-audit-v3) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py; output: docs/media/epithelial_buckling_3d_comparison.png; organism: Mus musculus / Drosophila melanogaster epithelial monolayers; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/654cd6fc; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7, Pillow 12.0.0; spec_fingerprint: c058d57a2503a59a583412118501c0ee7c1d08eac1445bb91a576986cd7b311b; artifact_sha256: 6269de61be241e71465e8aaa782e2860e0546a4d15b07d1fcaf6eceb76858a74; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_buckling_3d_reference.json=eef9f75ed38ce872..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg=cd05cc85a7f49dd2..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/paper_citations.bib=77a77d7dc42170a5..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/scout_manifest.json=99741cb299962b18..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/scutoid_tube_reference.json=85d9db6cbb5b95ff...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-epithelial-buckling-3d-audit-v2; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014): single-cell energy E_cell(A) = (Gamma_a + Gamma_b) A + c Gamma_l V_0 / (2 sqrt A) gives h_0/d_0 = c Gamma_l / [4 (Gamma_a + Gamma_b)] spanning squamous/cuboidal/columnar; an elastic foundation selects lambda_c = 2 pi (kappa_eff / K_sub)^(1/4); apico-basal tension asymmetry sets a spontaneous curvature whose sign follows Gamma_a - Gamma_b | Krajnc & Ziherl (2015): convexity of the cell energy at equilibrium and the continuum elastic limit of the 3D vertex monolayer | Gómez-Gálvez et al. (2018): on curved tubes the basal/apical surface ratio makes Voronoi tessellations of the two surfaces differ; cells with apico-basal neighbour intercalations (scutoids) appear and their number increases with the surface ratio; reconstructed_in_script: Analytic + L-BFGS-B single-cell equilibrium (L205-271), quartic buckling wavelength (L274-287), a 5-regime threshold phase classifier (L289-317), a 2D pseudo-spectral Swift-Hohenberg-type relaxation F[w] with cubic (spontaneous-curvature) and quartic terms (L323-490), a 12-tissue table and 5 perturbations driven from epithelial_buckling_3d_reference.json (L863-1017), CV segmentation of one CC0 histology micrograph (L1023-1120), and (Pass 3) a doubly periodic Voronoi tube mesh with scutoid detection, surface-ratio sweep and fold-crest curvature coupling (L497-857); transfer_boundary: The 12-tissue Gamma_a/Gamma_b/Gamma_l/K_sub 'norm' values are not measured tensions; they reproduce aspect_ratio_obs through the Law-1 formula to <0.5 % per row and carry no per-row source, so the r = 1.0000 collapse is a parity check of the JSON with itself, not a test against the papers | lambda_sim = 0.85 lambda_c + 0.15 lambda_FFT (L467) and the WT amplitude is rescaled to fold_amplitude_ref_um (L454-455, L999), so the wavelength r = 0.9993 and the WT amplitude 'match' are dominated by construction | The scutoid mesh is a Voronoi projection (seeds fixed, lateral faces evaluated geometrically); it is not a relaxed 3D vertex model and no Gómez-Gálvez figure value is digitised - the scutoid reference values are geometric identities (f_s(1) = 0, mean neighbours 6, Spearman 1) plus a crest ratio derived from the already-pinned WT fold geometry; does_not_claim: A relaxed 3D vertex/scutoid energy (apical, basal and lateral tensions minimised with free vertices), T1 or apico-basal intercalation dynamics, quantitative agreement with the Gómez-Gálvez scutoid counts in salivary gland / egg chamber tubes, measured per-tissue surface tensions, or more than one histological specimen]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bpj.2015.11.024>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-06497-3>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1321766111>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.92.052713> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.824"^^xsd:double .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
        schema:version "654cd6fc" .
}

